The '''2024–25 season''' was the 125th season in the history of '''[[RCD Espanyol]]''', and the club's first season back in [[La Liga]] following promotion from the [[Segunda División]]. In addition to the [[2024–25 La Liga|domestic league]], the club participated in the [[2024–25 Copa del Rey|Copa del Rey]].

